    "steam_appid": 3214390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214390/extras/730aafaa83baabb6830e1c4160acbb85.avif?t=1732877780\" width=616 height=220 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><br>In 'Stranger Watch' players step into the shoes of an elementary school student in a town plagued by recent sightings of suspicious figures. As they make their way home, it\u2019s up to them to spot and report these lurking dangers<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br>My teacher told us that there have been a lot of reports of &quot;suspicious people&quot; being spotted around the school recently, so we need to be careful on our way home for a while.<br><br>My house is close to the school, but I still feel scared.<br><br>The teacher said that if someone suspicious talks to us or we see anything strange, we should tell the police right away.<br><br>Now, on my way home, everyone I pass looks like they might be suspicious. But to be honest, I can't really tell who's suspicious and who's not.<br><br>I\u2019ll do my best to stay safe on my way home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Points of the Game</h2>.<br><strong>Get home safely from school to your home</strong><br>Various residents live in a residential area depicted in 3D graphics. People you see on your way home from school. There may be a \u201csuspicious person\u201d lurking among them. If you find one, immediately report it to the police! The game progresses by reporting \u201csuspicious persons.<br><br><strong>Judgment of a suspicious person</strong><br>You should not be careless in judging whether someone looks \u201csuspicious\u201d or not. A person who looks normal may in fact be a \u201csuspicious person. Or, a person who looks \u201csuspicious\u201d may actually be a good person, but you may be mistaken. Observe the characters carefully.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Live Streaming</h2>We\u2019re excited to see gameplay videos from both individuals and companies.<br>Before you start streaming or posting, please keep these points in mind:<br><br>* Please include the store page URL in the video description or another easily accessible place for viewers.<br>* Monetization through features provided by the video platform (e.g., ad revenue, donations) is allowed.<br>* Content that is slanderous or offensive to public order and morals is strictly prohibited.<br>* Good Luck3, Inc. is not liable for any damages or issues that arise during the distribution of gameplay videos.",
